Preorder: 1 2 4 5 3 
Postorder: 4 5 2 3 1 
Level Order: 1 2 3 4 5 
Max Depth: 3
Total Nodes: 5
Sum of Nodes: 15
Search 5: true
Trees Identical: true
Mirror Inorder: 3 1 5 2 4
